%% Sequence: Registration portal RPA (HA4)
%% Actors aligned with locked field map

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Officer
  participant Visa as Visa2026
  participant Filing as MigrationPortalFiling
  participant Worker as PortalFiling Worker
  participant Portal as rgstr.migration.gov.tm

  Officer->>Visa: Open Registration case · linked People are the filing set
  Officer->>Visa: Click Queue for migration portal (DetailView)
  Visa->>Visa: Validate passport/DOB/photo/visa dates<br/>same AddressOfResidence · PortalWorkplace
  alt Validation fails
    Visa-->>Officer: Refuse queue · gaps
  else Validation OK
    Visa->>Filing: Create/update filing + job Ready
    Worker->>Visa: Poll / claim Ready job
    Worker->>Worker: Attach persistent browser profile
    alt Session still valid
      Worker->>Portal: Already logged in
    else Login page shown
      Note over Worker: PortalLogin config on worker PC<br/>cellphone + SMS code (~10 days)
      Worker->>Portal: Enter cellphone + SMS code as password
    end
    Worker->>Portal: Set language tk
    Worker->>Portal: Click + Add application (/panel/applications/create/)
    Note over Portal: Portal auto-creates ID + Creation date
    Portal-->>Worker: Redirect edit/{id}/ Unfinished
    Worker->>Filing: Store PortalApplicationId + PortalCreatedOn
    Worker->>Visa: Set FullApplicationNumber + ApplicationDate from portal ID + date
    Note over Worker,Filing: ID from URL/header · date from list/UI
    loop Each selected person
      Worker->>Portal: Search passport + DOB
      Worker->>Portal: Upload Person.Photo · Add citizen
    end
    Worker->>Portal: Fill stay · visa dates · workplace · letter fields<br/>attachments from Required person-related data copies × roster
    Worker->>Filing: Job DraftOnScreen + screenshot
    Worker-->>Officer: Review draft
    alt Reject
      Officer->>Filing: Failed / Ready again
    else ConfirmSave
      Officer->>Filing: Confirmed
      Worker->>Portal: Save
      Worker->>Filing: Saved
    end
  end